"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[850],{7850:function(e,t,n){var i={translations:{en:n(6992),de:n(3986)},defaultLang:"de",useBrowserDefault:!0};e.exports=i},3986:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"language":{"selector":"Sprache","de":"\ud83c\udde9\ud83c\uddea Deutsch","en":"\ud83c\uddec\ud83c\udde7 Englisch"},"nav":{"projectAndVision":"Projekt","jobs":"Mitmachen","features":"Funktionen"},"index":{"heroShortsPrice":"Kostenlos","heroShortsAuthor":"von Studierenden","heroShortsOpen":"Open Source","mainHeadingTUfast":"Dein Produktivit\xe4tstool f\xfcr\xa0die\xa0TU\xa0Dresden","subHeading":"Schneller durch die Online Tools der\xa0TU\xa0Dresden navigieren","installPrompt":"Zu","installPromptBehind":"hinzuf\xfcgen \u2192","installPromptHeader":"Zu","installPromptBehindHeader":"hinzuf\xfcgen","availableFor":"verf\xfcgbar f\xfcr [Chrome,]({{chrome}}) [Firefox]({{firefox}}) und [Edge]({{chrome}}) Browser","newFeatureHint":"Jetzt auch f\xfcr Firefox Mobil","featureSectionTitle":"Was kann TUfast?","featureLoginTitle":"Automatisches Anmelden","featureLoginText":"Logge dich automatisch in alle Online-Portale an: selma, OPAL, SLUB, Mail, ...","featureNavTitle":"Verbesserte Navigation","featureNavText":"Schnellzugriff und Hotkeys f\xfcr viele Online-Portale","featureOpalTitle":"OPAL \xdcbersicht","featureOpalText":"Alle deine Kurse direkt im Browser, ohne OPAL aufrufen zu m\xfcssen","featureImproveTitle":"Verbessertes selma & OPAL","featureImproveText":"\xd6ffne Dokumente direkt im Browser, verbessertes Layout, Notenverteilung und Versuchstracker","safetySectionTitle":"Ist TUfast sicher?","safetyDataTitle":"Datenspeicherung ausschlie\xdflich lokal","safetyDataText":"TU FAST speichert nutzerbezogene Daten ausschlie\xdflich lokal auf deinem Ger\xe4t. Wenn du die Erweiterung l\xf6schst, werden auch alle deine Daten gel\xf6scht. Weitere Informationen findest du in unserer [Datenschutzerkl\xe4rung](https://tu-fast.de/datenschutz).","safetyMoneyTitle":"Kostenlos & Open Source","safetyMoneyText":"TUfast ist ein [Open-Source Projekt](https://github.com/TUfast-TUD/TUfast_TUD). Das bedeutet wir arbeiten 100% transparent. Du kannst dir den Code jederzeit selbst auf GitHub anschauen und mitwirken. TUfast ist f\xfcr dich kostenlos.","aboutSectionTitle":"Warum ist Online Studieren so kompliziert?","aboutText":["An der TU Dresden jonglieren wir t\xe4glich mit OPAL, Selma, Hisqis oder Outlook und verlieren dabei Zeit und Nerven. Also haben wir uns gefragt: Geht das nicht einfacher? Aus dieser Frage entstand TUfast. Zuerst als kleines Nebenprojekt im Studium, dann als wachsende Plattform, die schnell immer mehr Studierende erreichte. Was mit ein paar Zeilen Code begann, wurde zu einer gemeinsamen Mission: den digitalen Studienalltag an der TU Dresden leichter zu machen.","Heute ist TUfast ein Open-Source-Projekt von Studierenden und Alumni der TU Dresden. Es wird von \xfcber 4000 Studierenden und Mitarbeitenden an der TU Dresden genutzt. Alle die am Projekt mitwirken, tun das ehrenamtlich und mit dem Wunsch anderen Studierenden, die Online Lehre ein St\xfcck leichter zu machen.","Unterst\xfctzt wird das Projekt unter anderem vom [DigitalAcceleratorProgramm des Stifterverbands](https://www.stifterverband.org/digitalchangemaker-accelerator), der [output.dd Projektschau](https://output-dd.de/blog/project-post/tufast-tu-dresden-2/) der Informatik-Fakult\xe4t, mehreren Fachschaftsr\xe4ten der TU Dresden sowie netten Sponsoren und Sponsorinnen auf [BuyMeACoffee](https://www.buymeacoffee.com/olihausdoerfer). Am Ziel sind wir noch nicht: Unser n\xe4chster Schritt ist es, TUfast weiter auszubauen \u2013 f\xfcr die TU Dresden, f\xfcr andere Hochschulen in Sachsen und f\xfcr alle, die in der digitalen Lehre ein bisschen mehr Struktur und Leichtigkeit brauchen.","**Von Studierenden, f\xfcr Studierende. Kostenlos und Open Source.**"],"teamSectionTitle":"Das Team","participateSectionTitle":"Gestalte TUfast mit!"},"projectAndVision":{"content":["","***"]},"team":{"card":{"role":"Position","studies":"Studium","activity":"T\xe4tigkeiten"},"members":[{"status":"Aktiv","name":"Oliver Hausd\xf6rfer","image":"https://hausdoerfer.de/ohausdoerfer2.jpg","role":"Teamleitung","studies":"PhD student. M.Sc. Robotics, TU Munich. Alumni B.Sc. Maschinenbau, TU Dresden.","occupancy_in_tufast":"Projektmanagement","links":[{"type":"github","title":"GitHub","url":"https://github.com/OliEfr"},{"type":"other","title":"Website","url":"https://oliver.hausdoerfer.de/"}]},{"status":"Aktiv","name":"Lennart Guderian","image":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64439978","role":"Co-Teamleitung","studies":"Dipl.-Ing. Mechatronik, TU Dresden","occupancy_in_tufast":"Design, Front-End, Entwicklung TUfast","links":[{"type":"github","title":"GitHub","url":"https://github.com/Noxdor"}]},{"status":"Aktiv","name":"AKORA","role":"Entwicklung TUfast","image":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65976562","studies":"Studium Bachelor Informatik","occupancy_in_tufast":"Verbesserungen in Selma","links":[{"type":"github","title":"GitHub","url":"https://github.com/A-K-O-R-A"}]},{"status":"Aktiv","name":"Tom","role":"Entwicklung TUfast","image":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65157178","studies":"Studium Bachelor Informatik","occupancy_in_tufast":"TUfast f\xfcr Safari Browser","links":[{"type":"github","title":"GitHub","url":"https://github.com/t0mbrn"}]},{"status":"Aktiv","name":"Steen Thomsen","role":"Design","image":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199160993","studies":"Studium Angewandte Informatik","occupancy_in_tufast":"Redesign 2025, Design, Frontend","links":[{"type":"github","title":"GitHub","url":"https://github.com/thomsste"}]},{"status":"Ehemalig","name":"Jan Polzer","image":"https://hausdoerfer.de/jpolzer.jpg","role":"Leitung Marketing","studies":"Alumni Medizin, TU Dresden","occupancy_in_tufast":"Marketing, \xd6ffentlichkeitsarbeit","links":[]},{"status":"Ehemalig","name":"Fugi","image":"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/ba104599ebbe494f2f8a9e29ebcf0ed7?s=512","role":"Leitung Website","studies":"Alumni B.Sc. Informatik, TU Dresden","occupancy_in_tufast":"Entwicklung Website, Backend","links":[{"type":"other","title":"Website","url":"https://fugi.dev"}]},{"status":"Ehemalig","name":"Daniel Kluge","role":"Leitung TUfast Entwicklung","image":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43993811","studies":"Alumni Dipl.-Ing. Informationssystemtechnik","occupancy_in_tufast":"Entwicklung TUfast, Web-Extension","links":[{"type":"github","title":"GitHub","url":"https://github.com/C0ntroller"},{"type":"other","title":"Website","url":"https://c0ntroller.de"}]},{"status":"Aktiv","name":"Du?","role":"\xdcber GitHub kann jede\xb7r bei dem Projekt mitmachen!","image":"https://tu-fast.de/member-github.png","studies":"","occupancy_in_tufast":"Weiter unten findest du ein paar Ideen, du kannst aber gerne auch deine eigenen einbringen.","links":[{"type":"github","title":"GitHub","url":"https://github.com/TUfast-TUD/"},{"type":"other","title":"Website","url":"https://tu-fast.de/#mitmachen"}]}]},"jobs":{"content":["Das Coole an TUfast? **Echte Softwareentwicklung f\xfcr \xfcber 4000 Studierende und Mitarbeitende!**\\n\xdcber **GitHub** kann jede\xb7r mitentwickeln. Von kleinen Fixes bis zu neuen Features. ","Wenn du mitmachen willst, schreib uns an [frage@tu-fast.de](mailto:frage@tu-fast.de).\\nOder starte direkt auf [GitHub](https://github.com/TUfast-TUD/TUfast_TUD) (siehe [Contributing.md](https://github.com/TUfast-TUD/TUfast_TUD/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)).","Hier findest du **Ideen zum Mitmachen**, wir freuen uns aber auch \xfcber deine eigenen Vorschl\xe4ge! :)"],"listings":[{"title":"TUfast f\xfcr Safari","tags":["Entwicklung"],"content":"Wir bekommen viele Anfragen, dass TUfast auch Safari unterst\xfctzen soll. Du kennst dich mit Programmierung f\xfcr macOS/Safari aus? Dann tu\' deinen Mitstudierenden etwas Gutes und \xfcbernimm die Implementierung! \\n\\n Learnings: Verteilung von Webextensions, Webentwicklung, macOS/Safari"},{"title":"TUfast f\xfcr Mobil","tags":["Entwicklung"],"content":"Service-Workers sind der letzte Schrei der Webtechnologien und einer der gr\xf6\xdften Zukunftstrends - deswegen m\xf6chten wir auch auf diese umstellen. Das erm\xf6glicht, TUfast f\xfcr mobile Ger\xe4te verf\xfcgbar zu machen und viele neue Funktionen. \\n\\n Learnings: Mobile Optimierung, Service workers"},{"title":"TUfast f\xfcr HTW (und andere Hochschulen)","tags":["Entwicklung","Produktmanagement","Projektmanagement"],"content":"TUfast ist gro\xdfartig - das haben auch schon Studierende der HTW bemerkt. Bis Ende des Jahres m\xf6chten wir daher TUfast auch f\xfcr die HTW verf\xfcgbar machen. Das beinhaltet: Entwurf eines Softwarekonzepts zur Integration weiterer Hochschulen und Implementierung f\xfcr die HTW. \\n\\n Learnings: Softwaredesign, Webentwicklung, nutzerorientierte Entwicklung"},{"title":"IT-Sicherheit","tags":["Entwicklung","IT-Security"],"content":"Du hast Spa\xdf an IT-Security? Wir suchen nach jemanden, der diesen Bereich bei TUfast \xfcbernehmen m\xf6chte. Wir haben bereits R\xfccksprache mit der IT-Sicherheit der TU Dresden und damit Implementierungsvorschl\xe4ge erhalten. Zuk\xfcnftig m\xf6chten wir die IT-Sicherheit gerne intern beurteilen und entsprechende Ma\xdfnahmen implementieren. \\n\\n Learnings: IT-Sicherheit, Web-Sicherheit, Webentwicklung"},{"title":"TUfast Telemetry","tags":["Entwicklung","Produktmanagement"],"content":"Mit 100% anonymen Nutzungsdaten wollen wir TUfast weiter verbessern. Diese Nutzungsdaten sollen auf unserer Website ver\xf6ffentlicht werden. Du \xfcberlegst dir, wie das am Besten umgesetzt werden kann (ClickHouse, OpenTelemetry). \\n\\n Learnings: Produkttelemetrie, Backend Design und Implementierung"},{"title":"Marketing","tags":["Projektmanagement","Marketing"],"content":"Wir sch\xe4tzen Marketing als elementaren Bestandteil unseres Projekts. Unser Ziel ist es, TUfast zu verbreiten, weshalb kreatives Marketing eine gro\xdfe Rolle spielt! Du willst Erfahrungen im Bereich Marketing und Produktkommunikation sammeln? Dann bist du hier genau richtig! \\n\\n Learnings: Design, Markenkommunikation, Projektverantwortung"},{"title":"Projektmanagement","tags":["Produktmanagement","Projektmanagement"],"content":"Ein Team ist nur so gut, wie die gemeinsame Vision. Im Projektmanagement wird die Vision koordiniert und die Realisierung erm\xf6glicht. Dazu geh\xf6ren das Einwerben von F\xf6rdergeldern, Kommunikation zu Project-Stake-Holdern und allgemeines Projektmanagement. \\n\\n Learnings: Projektverantwortung, Teamleitung, Stake-Holder Kommunikation"}]}}')},6992:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"language":{"selector":"Language","de":"\ud83c\udde9\ud83c\uddea German","en":"\ud83c\uddec\ud83c\udde7 English"},"nav":{"projectAndVision":"Project","jobs":"Participate","features":"Features"},"index":{"heroShortsPrice":"Free to use","heroShortsAuthor":"made by students","heroShortsOpen":"Open Source","mainHeadingTUfast":"Your productivity tool for\xa0TU\xa0Dresden","subHeading":"Navigate faster through TU\xa0Dresden\'s\xa0online\xa0tools","installPrompt":"Add to","installPromptBehind":"now \u2192","installPromptHeader":"Add to","installPromptBehindHeader":"now","availableFor":"available for [Chrome,]({{chrome}}) [Firefox]({{firefox}}) and [Edge]({{chrome}}) browser","newFeatureHint":"Now also available for Firefox Mobile","featureSectionTitle":"What can TUfast do?","featureLoginTitle":"Automatic login","featureLoginText":"Log in automatically to all online portals: selma, OPAL, SLUB, Mail, ...","featureNavTitle":"Improved navigation","featureNavText":"Quick access and hotkeys for many online portals","featureOpalTitle":"OPAL Overview","featureOpalText":"All your courses directly in your browser, without having to open OPAL","featureImproveTitle":"Improved selma & OPAL","featureImproveText":"Open documents directly in your browser, improved layout, grade distribution, and attempt tracker","safetySectionTitle":"Is TUfast secure?","safetyDataTitle":"Data is only stored locally","safetyDataText":"TU FAST stores user-related data only locally on your device. If you delete the extension, all your data will also be deleted. For more information, please refer to our [privacy policy](https://tu-fast.de/datenschutz).","safetyMoneyTitle":"Free & Open Source","safetyMoneyText":"TUfast is an [open-source project](https://github.com/TUfast-TUD/TUfast_TUD). This means we work with 100% transparency. You can view the code yourself on GitHub at any time and contribute. TUfast is free for you to use.","aboutSectionTitle":"Why is studying online so complicated?","aboutText":["At TU Dresden, we juggle OPAL, Selma, Hisqis, and Outlook every day, wasting time and fraying our nerves in the process. So we asked ourselves: Can\'t this be done more easily? This question gave rise to TUfast. It started as a small side project during our studies, then grew into a platform that quickly reached more and more students. What began with a few lines of code became a shared mission: to make everyday digital life at TU Dresden easier.","Today, TUfast is an open-source project run by students and alumni of TU Dresden. It is used by over 4,000 students at TU Dresden. Everyone involved in the project does so on a voluntary basis and with the desire to make online teaching a little easier for other students.","The project is supported by, among others, the [DigitalAcceleratorProgramm des Stifterverbands](https://www.stifterverband.org/digitalchangemaker-accelerator), the [output.dd project show](https://output-dd.de/blog/project-post/tufast-tu-dresden-2/) of the Faculty of Computer Science, several student councils at TU Dresden, and generous sponsors on [BuyMeACoffee](https://www.buymeacoffee.com/olihausdoerfer). We are not there yet: Our next step is to further expand TUfast\u2014for TU Dresden, for other universities in Saxony, and for anyone who needs a little more structure and ease in digital teaching.","**By students, for students. Free and open source.**"],"teamSectionTitle":"The Team","participateSectionTitle":"Help shape TUfast!"},"projectAndVision":{"content":["","***"]},"team":{"card":{"role":"Position","studies":"Studies","activity":"Work"},"members":[{"status":"Active","name":"Oliver Hausd\xf6rfer","image":"https://hausdoerfer.de/ohausdoerfer2.jpg","role":"Team Lead","studies":"PhD student. M.Sc. Robotics, TU Munich. Alumni B.Sc. Mechanical Engineering, TU Dresden.","occupancy_in_tufast":"Project management","links":[{"type":"github","title":"GitHub","url":"https://github.com/OliEfr"},{"type":"other","title":"Website","url":"https://oliver.hausdoerfer.de/"}]},{"status":"Active","name":"Lennart Guderian","image":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64439978","role":"Team Co-Lead","studies":"Dipl.-Ing. Mechatronics, TU Dresden","occupancy_in_tufast":"Design, development, front-end","links":[{"type":"github","title":"GitHub","url":"https://github.com/Noxdor"}]},{"status":"Active","name":"AKORA","role":"Entwicklung TUfast","image":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65976562","studies":"Studying Computer Science","occupancy_in_tufast":"Selma Improvements","links":[{"type":"github","title":"GitHub","url":"https://github.com/A-K-O-R-A"}]},{"status":"Active","name":"Tom","role":"Entwicklung TUfast","image":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65157178","studies":"Studying Computer Science","occupancy_in_tufast":"TUfast f\xfcr Safari Browser","links":[{"type":"github","title":"GitHub","url":"https://github.com/t0mbrn"}]},{"status":"Active","name":"Steen Thomsen","role":"Design","image":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199160993","studies":"Studying Applied Computer Science","occupancy_in_tufast":"Redesign 2025, Design, Frontend","links":[{"type":"github","title":"GitHub","url":"https://github.com/thomsste"}]},{"status":"Former","name":"Jan Polzer","image":"https://hausdoerfer.de/jpolzer.jpg","role":"Marketing Lead","studies":"Alumni Medical studies, TU Dresden","occupancy_in_tufast":"Marketing, PR","links":[]},{"status":"Former","name":"Fugi","image":"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/ba104599ebbe494f2f8a9e29ebcf0ed7?s=512","role":"Website Lead","studies":"Alumni B.Sc. Computer Science, TU Dresden","occupancy_in_tufast":"Development, backend, website","links":[{"type":"other","title":"Website","url":"https://fugi.dev"}]},{"status":"Former","name":"Daniel Kluge","role":"TUfast Development Lead","image":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43993811","studies":"Alumni Dipl.-Ing. Information Systems Engineering, TU Dresden","occupancy_in_tufast":"Development, web-extension","links":[{"type":"github","title":"GitHub","url":"https://github.com/C0ntroller"},{"type":"other","title":"Website","url":"https://c0ntroller.de"}]},{"status":"Active","name":"You?","role":"Anyone can participate in the project via GitHub!","image":"https://tu-fast.de/member-github.png","studies":"","occupancy_in_tufast":"Below you will find a few ideas, but feel free to contribute your own.","links":[{"type":"github","title":"GitHub","url":"https://github.com/TUfast-TUD/"},{"type":"other","title":"Website","url":"https://tu-fast.de/#mitmachen"}]}]},"jobs":{"content":["What\'s cool about TUfast? **Real software development for over 4,000 students!**\\nAnyone can contribute via **GitHub**. From small fixes to new features.","If you want to join us, write to us at [frage@tu-fast.de](mailto:frage@tu-fast.de).\\nOr get started right away on [GitHub](https://github.com/TUfast-TUD/TUfast_TUD) (see [Contributing.md](https://github.com/TUfast-TUD/TUfast_TUD/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)).","Here you will find ideas for getting involved, but we would also love to hear your own suggestions! :)"],"listings":[{"title":"TUfast for Safari","tags":["Development"],"content":"We get many requests that TUfast should also support Safari. You have experience with developing for macOS/Safari? Then do your fellow students a favor and take over the implementation! \\n\\n Learnings: Distribution of web extensions, web development, macOS/Safari"},{"title":"TUfast for mobile","tags":["Development"],"content":"Service-Workers are the latest trend in web technologies - that\'s why we want to use them. This will enable us to make TUfast available for mobile devices and to add many new features. \\n\\n Learnings: Mobile optimization, service workers"},{"title":"TUfast for HTW (and other Universities)","tags":["Development","Product management","Project management"],"content":"TUfast is great - students at the HTW also noticed that. Therefore, we would like to make TUfast available for HTW as well. This includes: Designing a software concept to integrate more universities and implementing it for HTW. \\n\\n Learning: Software design, web development, user oriented services"},{"title":"IT Security","tags":["IT Security","Development"],"content":"You are interested in IT-Security? Perfect! We are looking for someone who looks into the security aspects of TUfast. We already got feedback and a scrutiny from the Informationssicherheit TU Dresden. In the future, we would like to evaluate security internally and implement measures accordingly. \\n\\n Learnings: IT security, Websecurity, Webdevelopment"},{"title":"TUfast Telemetry","tags":["Development","Product management"],"content":"We would like to collect anonymous usage data for TUfast to make the service even better. This data should be published on our website as well. Possible tools include Clickhouse or OpenTelemetry. \\n\\n Learnings: Product telemetry, back-end design and implementation"},{"title":"Marketing","tags":["Product management","Marketing"],"content":"We value marketing as a huge part of our project. Our goal is, to develop a clear brand communication and distribute TUfast to as many users as possible. You want to gather experience in marketing and brand communication? Then this is the perfect spot for you! \\n\\n Learnings: Design, brand communication, project responsibility"},{"title":"Project management","tags":["Product management","Project management"],"content":"A team is only as good as its shared vision. In project management, you make sure that this vision is communicated and achieved. This includes looking for project sponsors, communication to project stake-holders and general project management. \\n\\n Learnings: Project responsibility, leading, handling stake-holders"}]}}')}}]);